22:T15d5,<h3 id="delegate-setup">最初に用意するもの</h3><p>このページのコマンド例には、Python 3 と<a href="https://github.com/miyafcos/mycmux-team">公開リポジトリ</a>を手元に用意します。<strong>委譲 CLI</strong> は公開リポジトリの <code>scripts/mycmux_agent_cli.py</code> です。「設定 → AI → Claude Code スキル」から導入する方法もあります。エージェント側のルールにも、可視ペインで委譲する方針と CLI の場所を書いておきます。</p><p>エージェントが mycmux の中にいるかは、環境変数 <code>MYCMUX_TERM_PROGRAM</code> が <code>mycmux</code> かどうかで判定できます。自分のペインとそのセッション ID は <code>MYCMUX_TAB_ID</code> と <code>MYCMUX_PANE_SESSION_ID</code> で分かります。</p><p>環境変数の全一覧は、<a href="https://github.com/miyafcos/mycmux-team/blob/master/README.md">README（付録 F）</a>にあります。</p><p>エージェントは、Web ペインを裏で開く、読む、操作する作業もできます。</p><p>ページを開く、読み込みを待つ、要素を探して押す、文字を打つ、ファイルを添える、画面を撮る、閉じる、といった操作を委譲 CLI から使えます。</p><p>Windows では、実際のクリックやキー入力と同じ扱いの操作もできます。</p><p>Web ペインには印が付き、そこでの会話もダッシュボードの一覧に出ます。</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>環境変数</th><th>エージェントが確認できるもの</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>MYCMUX_MARKDOWN_OUT</code></td> <td>Markdown の成果物の出力先</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>MYCMUX_HTML_OUT</code></td> <td>HTML の成果物の出力先</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>MYCMUX_ARTIFACTS_DIR</code></td><td>そのセッションの成果物フォルダ</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="handoff">引き継ぎ書を渡す</h3>
<p>mycmux 内で、取得したリポジトリのルートから実行する例です。先に <code>task.md</code> へ、目的、変更してよい範囲、完了条件を書いておきます。</p>
<pre><code class="language-bash">python scripts/mycmux_agent_cli.py spawn --target codex --prompt-file task.md
</code></pre>
<p>呼び出し元のタブに、新しいペインが裏ペインとして開きます。いま操作しているペインは移動しません。</p><p><code>spawn</code> の起動方法は 4 つあり、同時には 1 つだけ指定します。</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>指定</th><th>起動のしかた</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>--prompt</code> か <code>--prompt-file</code></td><td>指示書を読ませて始めます。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>--handoff-from-session</code></td><td>既存の会話の履歴から引き継ぎ書を作って渡します。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>--resume-session</code></td><td>セッション ID を指定して、その会話を再開します。</td></tr>
<tr><td>指定なし</td><td>新規に起動します。</td></tr></tbody></table>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>オプション</th><th>起動先や動作</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>指定なし</td><td>呼び出し元のタブに裏ペインを作り、フォーカスを移しません。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>--split</code></td><td>新しいタブを作ります。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>--workspace</code></td><td>分割先のワークスペースを ID で指定します。<code>--split</code> が必要です。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>--anchor-pane</code></td><td>分割の基準となるタブを指定します。<code>--split</code> が必要です。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>--direction right</code></td><td>右に分割します。<code>--direction down</code> なら下です。<code>--split</code> と組み合わせます。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>--cwd</code>、<code>--label</code></td><td>作業フォルダとペインの表示名を指定します。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>--no-activate</code></td><td>起動先へフォーカスしないことを明示します。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>--activate</code></td><td>起動先の選択を求めます。別のワークスペース自体は前面へ移しません。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>--model</code>、<code>--effort</code></td><td>ランチャーで選ぶのと同じモデルと effort を渡します。</td></tr></tbody></table><p><code>--model</code> と <code>--effort</code> は、ランチャーの選択と同じ経路を通ります。指定しなければ CLI の既定で起動します。</p><p>旗と読める値など、渡せない値は黙って捨てずに拒否して返します。</p><p><code>--target</code> に指定できるのは <code>claude</code>、<code>codex</code>、<code>claude-codex</code>、<code>grok</code>、<code>agy</code>、<code>hermes</code> と、<code>shell</code>、<code>web</code> です。</p><p><code>--prompt</code> などで会話を継ぐ指定は、mycmux が会話を追える相手にだけ渡せます。agy と Hermes は会話ファイルを持たないため、対象になりません。</p><p>mycmux 内の親タブを特定できなければ、別タブに勝手に変更せずエラーで止まります。</p><p>右のタブに置くなら、次のように指定します。下の画面も、右のタブを使った配置です。</p>
<pre><code class="language-bash">python scripts/mycmux_agent_cli.py spawn --target codex --prompt-file task.md --split --direction right --no-activate
</code></pre>1a:["$","div","2",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$22"}}]
23:["$undefined",["$","img",null,{"src":"/shots/09_delegation-visible-tab.png","alt":"Claude Code の右のタブに開いた Codex","width":1920,"height":1080,"loading":"lazy","decoding":"async"}]]
1b:["$","figure","3",{"className":"shot shot-content","data-shot":"09_delegation-visible-tab","children":[["$","picture",null,{"children":"$23"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"fig-no","children":"図 2"}],"委譲先の Codex が右のタブに開いています。可視ペインなので、途中から直接指示を足せます。",["$","a",null,{"className":"shot-full","href":"/shots/09_delegation-visible-tab.png","children":"画像を原寸で開く"}]]}]]}]
24:Td32,<h3 id="subcommands">ほかのサブコマンド</h3><p>同じ CLI には、起動以外のサブコマンドもあります。委譲先の画面を読む、追加の指示を送る、といった操作に使います。</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>サブコマンド</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>workspaces</code>、<code>panes</code></td><td>ワークスペースとタブの一覧を出します。<code>send</code> と <code>read</code> に使う ID の確認用です。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>status</code></td><td>セッションの状態を読みます。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>read</code></td><td>端末の末尾を読みます（既定 80 行、最大 400 行）。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>send</code></td><td>動いている端末へ文字列やキーを送ります。</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>rename</code>、<code>close-tab</code></td><td>ペインの名前を変える、ペインを閉じる操作です。</td></tr></tbody></table><p><code>send</code> は生の端末入力です。宛先を間違えると別の作業を壊すため、先に <code>panes</code> で ID を確かめます。<code>--enter</code> を付けたときは、届いたことを確認できた場合だけ成功として返します。</p><p>全オプションと全一覧は、<a href="https://github.com/miyafcos/mycmux-team/blob/master/README.md">README（付録 C）</a>にあります。</p><p>別のワークスペースを先に作る場合は、<code>workspace-new --name review</code> を実行します。返った <code>workspaceId</code> を、<code>spawn --split --workspace</code> の値に渡します。</p><p>新しく作ったワークスペースへ最初のエージェントを起動すると、そこに出ている未使用の起動メニューが置き換わります。空のメニューだけのペインは残りません。</p><p>使い終わったワークスペースは <code>workspace-close --workspace &lt;id&gt;</code> で閉じます。表示中の画面は動かないので、人が見ている作業を邪魔しません。</p><p>表示中のワークスペースは閉じられず、拒否されます。閉じたワークスペースにある端末は終了します。</p><p><code>send</code> で本文だけを渡した場合、送信の確定まで済んだとは限りません。<code>--enter</code> や <code>--key</code> の結果は、到達を確認できたかまで調べます。<code>read</code> は端末の表示を返すもので、会話の全履歴ではありません。裏ペインも読み取れますが、最大 400 行の範囲です。</p><h3 id="done">終わったかを確かめる</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>確認するもの</th><th>分かること</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>指示書で場所を決めた完了マーカー</td><td>相手が完了を報告したか。</td></tr>
<tr><td>対象セッションのログの増分</td><td>作業や会話が進んでいるか。</td></tr>
<tr><td>編集ファイルの更新時刻と内容</td><td>成果物に実際の変更があるか。</td></tr></tbody></table><p>「保存しました」という返事だけでは、終わりにしません。指定した成果物とテスト結果まで照合します。実務での流れは、<a href="/recipes#handoff">引き継ぎ書つきで任せる例</a>にあります。</p>1c:["$","div","4",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$24"}}]
1d:["$","section","dashboard",{"id":"dashboard","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"複数の会話をまとめて見たい"}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><strong>ダッシュボード</strong>は、全ワークスペースのセッションを一覧で見る画面です。<span class=\"keys\"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"key-join\">+</span><kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"key-join\">+</span><kbd>G</kbd></span> で開き、<kbd>Esc</kbd> で戻ります。セッションは、ひとつのエージェントと続ける会話の単位です。</p>"}}],["$","figure","1",{"className":"fig","data-fig":"F5","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"fig-wide","viewBox":"0 0 720 420","width":"100%","role":"img","aria-label":"ダッシュボードの見取り図。上に質問カードの帯と見守り、左に一覧、中央に会話列と入力欄、右に配置図","data-vw":720,"data-fs":15,"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","children":[["$","title",null,{"children":"ダッシュボードの見取り図。上に質問カードの帯と見守り、左に一覧、中央に会話列と入力欄、右に配置図"}],["$","defs",null,{"children":[["$","marker",null,{"id":"F5-wide-arrow","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead"}]}],["$","marker",null,{"id":"F5-wide-arrow-accent","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead accent"}]}]]}],[],[["$","g","db",{"className":"node n-group","data-w":720,"data-id":"db","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":0,"y":0,"width":720,"height":420,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":12,"textAnchor":"start","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":12,"y":24.75,"className":"title","children":"ダッシュボード　Ctrl+Shift+G"}]]}]]}],["$","g","q",{"className":"node n-accent","data-w":696,"data-id":"q","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":12,"y":42,"width":696,"height":40,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":360,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":360,"y":67.25,"className":"title","children":"質問カードの帯　Claude Code の質問に選択肢で答える"}]]}]]}],["$","g","wt",{"className":"node n-box","data-w":696,"data-id":"wt","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":12,"y":92,"width":696,"height":36,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":360,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":360,"y":115.25,"className":"title","children":"委譲の見守り　最終チェック・次回・停止の理由"}]]}]]}],["$","g","list",{"className":"node n-box","data-w":200,"data-id":"list","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":12,"y":138,"width":200,"height":268,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":24,"textAnchor":"start","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":24,"y":173.75,"className":"title","children":"一覧（4 区分）"}],["$","tspan","1",{"x":24,"y":196.75,"className":"sub","children":"要回答"}],["$","tspan","2",{"x":24,"y":219.75,"className":"sub","children":"要確認"}],["$","tspan","3",{"x":24,"y":242.75,"className":"sub","children":"作業中"}],["$","tspan","4",{"x":24,"y":265.75,"className":"sub","children":"その他"}],["$","tspan","5",{"x":24,"y":288.75,"className":"sub","children":""}],["$","tspan","6",{"x":24,"y":311.75,"className":"sub","children":"計器行（各行の下）"}],["$","tspan","7",{"x":24,"y":334.75,"className":"sub","children":"モデル"}],["$","tspan","8",{"x":24,"y":357.75,"className":"sub","children":"コンテキスト占有率"}],["$","tspan","9",{"x":24,"y":380.75,"className":"sub","children":"概算コスト・ID"}]]}]]}],["$","g","chat",{"className":"node n-box","data-w":280,"data-id":"chat","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":224,"y":138,"width":280,"height":206,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":364,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":364,"y":223.25,"className":"title","children":"会話列"}],["$","tspan","1",{"x":364,"y":246.25,"className":"sub","children":"会話を 1〜5 列"}],["$","tspan","2",{"x":364,"y":269.25,"className":"sub","children":"「固定」で留める"}]]}]]}],["$","g","in",{"className":"node n-box","data-w":280,"data-id":"in","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":224,"y":354,"width":280,"height":52,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":364,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":364,"y":373.75,"className":"title","children":"入力欄"}],["$","tspan","1",{"x":364,"y":396.75,"className":"sub","children":"@ で宛先・Enter で送信"}]]}]]}],["$","g","map",{"className":"node n-box","data-w":192,"data-id":"map","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":516,"y":138,"width":192,"height":268,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":612,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":612,"y":242.75,"className":"title","children":"配置図"}],["$","tspan","1",{"x":612,"y":265.75,"className":"sub","children":"ワークスペース"}],["$","tspan","2",{"x":612,"y":288.75,"className":"sub","children":"→ タブ → ペイン"}],["$","tspan","3",{"x":612,"y":311.75,"className":"sub","children":"クリックで列を開く"}]]}]]}]],"$undefined"]}],"$undefined",["$","svg",null,{"className":"fig-narrow","viewBox":"0 0 350 490","width":"100%","role":"img","aria-label":"ダッシュボードの見取り図。上に質問カードの帯と見守り、左に一覧、中央に会話列と入力欄、右に配置図","data-vw":350,"data-fs":15,"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","children":[["$","title",null,{"children":"ダッシュボードの見取り図。上に質問カードの帯と見守り、左に一覧、中央に会話列と入力欄、右に配置図"}],["$","defs",null,{"children":[["$","marker",null,{"id":"F5-narrow-arrow","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead"}]}],["$","marker",null,{"id":"F5-narrow-arrow-accent","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":"$L25"}]]}],[],["$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c"],"$undefined"]}],"$L2d"]}],"$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31"]]}]
32:["$undefined",["$","img",null,{"src":"/shots/05_pane-tabs.png","alt":"Claude Code のペインとアイコンに畳まれたペインの帯","width":610,"height":90,"loading":"lazy","decoding":"async"}]]
1e:["$","section","notifications",{"id":"notifications","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"返事待ちや停止に気づきたい"}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>通知の入口、委譲の見守り、レート制限の扱い、短い知らせの 4 つです。</p><h3 id=\"notification-panel\">待機バッジから移る</h3><p>ペインとサイドバーの待機バッジで、人が関わらないと進まない状態に気づけます。該当するワークスペースとペインを選んで移ります。全ワークスペースの状態は、ダッシュボードでまとめて確かめます。</p><p>通知と通知サウンドは「設定 → 通知とレイアウト」で切り替えます。承認待ちの画面やレート制限が、検知の対象です。通知サウンドが有効なら、入力待ちの検知時に短いチャイムが鳴ります。対応が必要なペインへは、<span class=\"keys\"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"key-join\">+</span><kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"key-join\">+</span><kbd>A</kbd></span> で直接移れます。</p>"}}],["$","figure","1",{"className":"shot shot-content","data-shot":"05_pane-tabs","children":[["$","picture",null,{"children":"$32"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"fig-no","children":"図 6"}],"Claude Code の横に、アイコンに畳まれたペインが並んでいます。",["$","a",null,{"className":"shot-full","href":"/shots/05_pane-tabs.png","children":"画像を原寸で開く"}]]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>サイドバーのキャラクターにも、作業の状態が出ます。承認や質問では呼ぶ姿、エラーや枠切れでは困る姿、作業中は走る姿です。ターンが終わって未読なら知らせる姿、待機中なら寝る姿になります。待機バッジと合わせて、開く会話を選ぶ目印にできます。</p><p>承認の画面が 2 回続けて検出されなくなると、承認待ちを解除します。</p><h3 id=\"watch\">見守りと無応答の検知</h3><p>委譲の見守りは、同じ状態を 2 回続けて検知してから通知します。ダッシュボードには最終チェック時刻と、停止していればその理由が出ます。出力が少ないというだけでは、停止とは判定しません。</p><p>巡回で見つけた状態のうち、右下に知らせるのは人の操作が要る 3 種類だけです。判断を待っている、作業が検収で不合格になった、送信されていない入力が残っている、の 3 つです。知らせは「開発 の「調査レーン」が判断を待っています」のようにワークスペース名とペイン名で出て、「開く」でそのペインへ移ります。残りの状態はダッシュボードで確かめます。</p><p>標準の確認間隔は 10 分です。通知が多すぎる場合は、設定の「通知の敏感さ」で「控えめ」を選べます。見守りが停止中や未計測なら、帯に出る理由を確認します。</p><h3 id=\"rate-limit\">レート制限と休眠</h3><p>レート制限で止まったペインは「停止」ではなく「レート制限で待機中」として扱い、休眠処理の対象から外します。休眠したセッションを片づける時間は、「設定 → 自動化」で 30 分後などから選べます。</p><h3 id=\"toast\">トーストとエラー帯</h3><p>短い知らせの置き場は、画面右下のトーストです。画面の一部が止まったときは、その部分だけエラー帯に変わり、「再試行」で戻せます。重ねて開いた画面は、<kbd>Esc</kbd> か背景のクリックで閉じます。</p>"}}]]]}]
1f:["$","section","save",{"id":"save","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"作業を残して戻りたい"}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>作業を残す手段は 3 つです。再起動時の自動復元、区切りで作るセーブポイント、別の PC へ渡す受け渡しファイルを、時間の順に並べます。</p>"}}],["$","figure","1",{"className":"fig","data-fig":"F6","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"fig-wide","viewBox":"0 0 720 330","width":"100%","role":"img","aria-label":"今日・翌日・別の PC の時間軸に沿って、セーブポイントの作成、再開、受け渡しを並べた図","data-vw":720,"data-fs":15,"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","children":[["$","title",null,{"children":"今日・翌日・別の PC の時間軸に沿って、セーブポイントの作成、再開、受け渡しを並べた図"}],["$","defs",null,{"children":[["$","marker",null,{"id":"F6-wide-arrow","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead"}]}],["$","marker",null,{"id":"F6-wide-arrow-accent","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead accent"}]}]]}],[["$","g","0",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M120 152L120 194","className":"edge","markerEnd":"$undefined"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","1",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M360 152L360 194","className":"edge","markerEnd":"$undefined"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","2",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M600 152L600 194","className":"edge","markerEnd":"$undefined"}],"$undefined"]}]],[["$","g","d1",{"className":"node n-box","data-w":200,"data-id":"d1","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":20,"y":0,"width":200,"height":86,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":120,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":120,"y":25.25,"className":"title","children":"「セーブポイントを作成」"}],["$","tspan","1",{"x":120,"y":48.25,"className":"sub","children":"要約・引き継ぎ書 ・"}],["$","tspan","2",{"x":120,"y":71.25,"className":"sub","children":"復元情報の 3 点"}]]}]]}],["$","g","d1b",{"className":"node n-box","data-w":200,"data-id":"d1b","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":20,"y":100,"width":200,"height":52,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":120,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":120,"y":119.75,"className":"title","children":"再起動は自動復元"}],["$","tspan","1",{"x":120,"y":142.75,"className":"sub","children":"Ctrl+Shift+T で戻す"}]]}]]}],["$","g","d2",{"className":"node n-box","data-w":200,"data-id":"d2","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":260,"y":0,"width":200,"height":86,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":360,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":360,"y":25.25,"className":"title","children":"「セーブポイントを開く」"}],["$","tspan","1",{"x":360,"y":48.25,"className":"sub","children":"引き継ぎ書を渡す"}],["$","tspan","2",{"x":360,"y":71.25,"className":"sub","children":"か、会話ごと続ける"}]]}]]}],["$","g","d2b",{"className":"node n-box","data-w":200,"data-id":"d2b","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":260,"y":100,"width":200,"height":52,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":360,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":360,"y":119.75,"className":"title","children":"Ctrl+P の Resume"}],["$","tspan","1",{"x":360,"y":142.75,"className":"sub","children":"過去の会話を検索"}]]}]]}],["$","g","d3",{"className":"node n-box","data-w":200,"data-id":"d3","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":500,"y":0,"width":200,"height":86,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":600,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":600,"y":25.25,"className":"title","children":"「人に渡す」"}],["$","tspan","1",{"x":600,"y":48.25,"className":"sub","children":".mycmux-transfer 1 件"}],["$","tspan","2",{"x":600,"y":71.25,"className":"sub","children":"「受け取る」かドロップ"}]]}]]}],["$","g","d3b",{"className":"node n-box","data-w":200,"data-id":"d3b","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":500,"y":100,"width":200,"height":52,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":600,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":600,"y":119.75,"className":"title","children":"作業フォルダは含まない"}],["$","tspan","1",{"x":600,"y":142.75,"className":"sub","children":"別途用意する"}]]}]]}],["$","g","p1",{"className":"node n-dot","data-w":14,"children":["$","circle",null,{"cx":120,"cy":201,"r":7}]}],["$","g","p2",{"className":"node n-dot","data-w":14,"children":["$","circle",null,{"cx":360,"cy":201,"r":7}]}],["$","g","p3",{"className":"node n-dot","data-w":14,"children":["$","circle",null,{"cx":600,"cy":201,"r":7}]}],["$","g","l1",{"className":"node n-plain","data-w":200,"data-id":"l1","children":[false,["$","text",null,{"x":120,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":120,"y":235.25,"className":"title","children":"今日"}]]}]]}],["$","g","l2",{"className":"node n-plain","data-w":200,"data-id":"l2","children":[false,["$","text",null,{"x":360,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":360,"y":235.25,"className":"title","children":"翌日"}]]}]]}],["$","g","l3",{"className":"node n-plain","data-w":200,"data-id":"l3","children":[false,["$","text",null,{"x":600,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":600,"y":235.25,"className":"title","children":"別の PC"}]]}]]}],["$","g","note",{"className":"node n-chip","data-w":400,"data-id":"note","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":160,"y":268,"width":400,"height":44,"rx":22}],["$","text",null,{"x":360,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":360,"y":295.25,"className":"title","children":"記録は 48 時間でゴミ箱へ　ピン留めで延長"}]]}]]}]],["$","path",null,{"d":"M20 201L700 201","className":"edge timeline"}]]}],"$undefined",["$","svg",null,{"className":"fig-narrow","viewBox":"0 0 350 560","width":"100%","role":"img","aria-label":"今日・翌日・別の PC の時間軸に沿って、セーブポイントの作成、再開、受け渡しを並べた図","data-vw":350,"data-fs":15,"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","children":["$L33","$L34",[],["$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38","$L39","$L3a","$L3b","$L3c","$L3d","$L3e","$L3f","$L40"],"$L41"]}],"$L42"]}],"$L43","$L44","$L45","$L46","$L47"]]}]
